0:{"buildId":"7afh9cBoHBO9HIwX4Lcyt","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"toc":[{"depth":2,"url":"#the-shift-this-section-represents","title":"The shift this section represents"},{"depth":2,"url":"#the-arc","title":"The arc"},{"depth":2,"url":"#start-here-or-skip-ahead","title":"Start here, or skip ahead"},{"depth":2,"url":"#current-pages","title":"Current pages"}],"children":[["$","$L3",null,{"children":"Operate"}],["$","$L4",null,{"children":"What to watch, what to tune, and what to do at 3am, once other people depend on your cluster."}],["$","$L5",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Who this is for:"}]," whoever gets paged when the build farm is slow. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"What\nyou'll have at the end of this section:"}]," a production-shaped deployment, a\nmetrics pipeline that tells you when it's unhealthy, and a written answer for\neach of the ways it fails. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Time:"}]," ongoing."]}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"data-prerequisites":true,"className":"my-6 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface-elevated px-5 py-3","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"my-0 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-brand","children":"Before you start"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground [&>p]:my-0","children":["$","p",null,{"children":["A Forge deployment you configured yourself. See ",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/configuration/your-first-full-config","children":"Your first full config"}],"."]}]}]]}],"\n",["$","$L7",null,{"as":"h2","id":"the-shift-this-section-represents","children":"The shift this section represents"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Everything up to the How-to guides is about making Forge do what you want.\nThis section is about making it keep doing that while you aren't looking.\nThe questions change shape: not \"how do I configure a filesystem store\" but\n\"what happens when that filesystem fills up overnight, how will I know, and what\ndo I do about it.\""}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"That's a different reader moment, so it's a different section, even though\nsome of the same subsystems come up."}],"\n",["$","$L7",null,{"as":"h2","id":"the-arc","children":"The arc"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Get the shape right."}]," The production configuration is not the quickstart\nconfiguration with bigger numbers. It has a fast tier over a durable one,\neviction policies that match your disk, and a deliberate split between the\npublic listeners and the worker API."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Deploy it somewhere real."}]," Docker Compose or bare metal, each with the\ntopology, the resource sizing, and the failure domains that go with it. For\nKubernetes, the Helm charts ship with ",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"https://enterprise.forge.com","children":"Forge Enterprise"}],"."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"See it."}]," OTLP to Prometheus to Grafana, and the specific metrics worth\nalerting on rather than all of them."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Scale it."}]," Workers scale on queue depth and action duration; the CAS\nscales on throughput and eviction pressure. They are separate problems with\nseparate signals, and conflating them is the most common scaling mistake."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Tune it."}]," A small number of levers move the needle. Most of the config\nsurface does not, and knowing which is which saves a lot of afternoons."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Harden it."}]," Port exposure, mTLS, and keeping the worker API private,\nwhich matters more than it sounds, because a worker API is an arbitrary code\nexecution endpoint by design."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Have runbooks."}]," Redis failover, worker OOM, disk full, backpressure. Each\none written down before it happens."]}],"\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld"]}],"$Le"]}],["$Lf","$L10"],"$L11"]}],"isPartial":"$@12","staleTime":"$13","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L14","isPartial":"$@15","staleTime":"$13","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L16","isPartial":"$@17","staleTime":"$13","varyParams":"$18"}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@19","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@1a"}
